@name     wave_to_ksynth
@alias    w>k
@group    sys
@c_name   skode_clause_wave_to_ksynth
@type     immediate
@arity    2
@match    (finite, finite)
@summary  bind wavetable samples to KSynth variable
@doc
Reads wavetable slot audio samples and binds to KSynth variable index.
Usage: w>k wave var
@code
    return skode_exec_w_gtk(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
